{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニ握手会4日目in富山ー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆき!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪がこーんなに積もってるの生まれて初めて見ました!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こーんなに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伝わると嬉しいんだけどなあ伝わらないかなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく考えてみたら、今日は記念すべき日本海側の県初上陸(o>ω<o)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで広島で、ぬくぬくのほほんと育ってきた15歳。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目の前に広がる雪景色が嬉しくて嬉しくて(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会とっても楽しかったです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段のひめたんは、寒いの苦手だから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い日はおうちでぬくぬくしてたいなって思いますよ多分。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(あ今日はもちろん別ね(*ゝω・*))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それなのに今日はたくさんの方に応援に来ていただいて、本当に幸せ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場の密度と、みなさんの手の温かさで、ぽっかぽかになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真冬の富山で汗かいたのよ(`・ω・')どやあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"富山も初めましての方がたくさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何せ乃木坂46としても初の富山イベントだもんねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はたくさんの方に乃木坂46のこと知っていただけてよかったな∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう。夜ごはんはお寿司!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名物の寒ブリもしっかり食べました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり海が近いだけあって、海の幸が美味しいですね(o>ω<o)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お寿司は4日間のご褒美かな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/26/6640661/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはゎ名古屋のどんな所がすきですか!!!!!??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みそカツが美味しいところ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"街がおしゃれなところ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋市民のみなさんが親切なところ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度名古屋でも握手会させていただけるみたいで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46にみなさんと触れ合えるきっかけを作ってくださる名古屋さま"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ好き(^ω^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/26/6640661/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お好み焼き食べた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニ握1日目の広島で食べましたっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもの味ながら美味しかったですよ(ω)*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/26/6640661/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな食べ物で、いちご以外になんかあります???"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お菓子は基本的に好きだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛減量中なので最近はセーブするように気をつけてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"といいつつ滋賀のうばがもち、京都の八つ橋を堪能したのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここだけの秘密と言うことにしておいてください(∀)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だめよ?誰かに喋っちゃだめだからね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやこれがちで内緒に..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/26/6640661/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(広島)前回のティッシュ配りの時に、スタッフさんにひめたんは?って何回か言って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アピールしたかいがあったかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てきてアピールしてくださったんですか(^O^)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは嬉しい!!ありがとうございます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はひめたんもスタッフさんに広島行きたいアピールしてたんですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのかいがあったのかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/26/6640661/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは広島弁でおってね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえっさ(`・ω・)ゝ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/26/6640661/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の次に推してもいいですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん喜んでっ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんもかなりん好きだけどいいですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/26/6640661/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握でひめたんに会いに行ってもいいですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのとき、ファンレター渡してもいいですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちも嬉しいですっ(*/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いに来てきてっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/02/26/6640661/0000.